# Figure and data files
*.fig
*.mat
*.svg
*.png
*.pdf

# Keep presentation/manuscript figure PNGs (override the global *.png ignore above)
!scripts/presentations/**/*.png
!scripts/stim_engages_adaptation/**/*.png

# Keep vector/source figure files for the manuscript only (override *.svg/*.fig);
# other presentations dirs stay PNG-only.
!scripts/presentations/Stability_Manuscript/**/*.svg
!scripts/presentations/Stability_Manuscript/**/*.fig

# Output/run directories (regenerable analysis outputs; keep out of git)
#
# figs/ is where make_all_paper_figures writes -- every figure, the doc tables,
# and a manifest naming the run_dir and commit that produced them. Deliberately
# NOT un-ignored: a full regeneration is ~200 MB of .fig/.svg, MATLAB .fig files
# differ byte-wise on every save so git cannot deduplicate them, and one figure
# alone (bursting_timeseries.fig) already accounts for 555 MB of this repo's
# history across seven commits. The final set is force-added at submission.
figs/
results_DDE/

# Ignore data/ contents, but BACK UP the run_all_jul_06_26_22_00 source data
# that many manuscript figures depend on. Parents are re-included stepwise
# (git won't descend into a fully-ignored dir); the final /** re-includes every
# file, overriding the *.mat/*.png/*.fig/*.svg/*.pdf rules above for this run.
data/*
!data/param_space/
data/param_space/*
!data/param_space/run_all_jul_06_26_22_00/
!data/param_space/run_all_jul_06_26_22_00/**

debug.log
